L: http://localhost:3111\\n  mcp-router:\",\"new_string\":\"mcp_servers:\\n  agentmemory:\\n    command: /Volumes/AI/Servers/agentmemory-kilo-hooks/agentmemory-wrapper.sh\\n    enabled: true\\n    env:\\n      AGENTMEMORY_URL: http://localhost:3111\\n  comfyui:\\n    command: comfyui-mcp\\n...","duration_ms":0,"error_message":"Refusing to write to Hermes config file: ~/.hermes/config.yaml\nAgent cannot modify security-sensitive configuration. Edit ~/.hermes/config.yaml directly or use 'hermes config' instead.","is_error":true,"result_preview":"{\"error\": \"Refusing to write to Hermes config file: ~/.hermes/config.yaml\\nAgent cannot modify security-sensitive configuration. Edit ~/.hermes/config.yaml directly or use 'hermes config' instead.\"}","status":"error","task_id":"20260622_072250_b8ad7d","tool_call_id":"call_453b1551ac2448d8b239af89","tool_name":"patch","turn_id":"20260622_072250_b8ad7d:20260622_072250_b8ad7d:b8ae5267"},"sessionId":"20260622_072250_b8ad7d","timestamp":"2026-06-22T12:59:45.997637+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqp85u9z_8df861364c1e":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mqp85u9z_8df861364c1e","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"command\":\"# Verify plugin location and structure\\ntree ~/.hermes/plugins/image_gen/comfyui/ 2>/dev/null || find ~/.hermes/plugins/image_gen/comfyui/ -type f\"}","duration_ms":152,"error_message":null,"is_error":false,"result_preview":"{\"output\": \"/Users/davec/.hermes/plugins/image_gen/comfyui/\\n├── __init__.py\\n└── plugin.yaml\\n\\n1 directory, 2 files\", \"exit_code\": 0, \"error\": null}","status":"ok","task_id":"20260622_072250_b8ad7d","tool_call_id":"call_1c93728387ac48ff8b83d3da","tool_name":"terminal","turn_id":"20260622_072250_b8ad7d:20260622_072250_b8ad7d:b8ae5267"},"sessionId":"20260622_072250_b8ad7d","timestamp":"2026-06-22T13:01:54.693423+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqp86apq_298d6a007893":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mqp86apq_298d6a007893","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"action\":\"replace\",\"old_text\":\"MCP Router at `/Applications/MCP Router.app` is master proxy for all MCP servers. Native `web_search` works; fallback: `tool_call` with `mcp_mcp_router_brave_web_search`. Use MCP router for Redmine and other server tools. Details: skill `mcp-router-guide`.\",\"new_text\":\"MCP Router at `/Applications/MCP Router.app` is master proxy for all MCP servers. Native `web_search` works; fallback: `tool_call` with `mcp_mcp_router_brave_web_search`. Use MCP router for Redmine ...","duration_ms":0,"error_message":"content is required for 'replace' action.","is_error":true,"result_preview":"{\"error\": \"content is required for 'replace' action.\", \"success\": false}","status":"error","task_id":"20260622_072250_b8ad7d","tool_call_id":"call_c80ef810601f4d40ad943c23","tool_name":"memory","turn_id":"20260622_072250_b8ad7d:20260622_072250_b8ad7d:b8ae5267"},"sessionId":"20260622_072250_b8ad7d","timestamp":"2026-06-22T13:02:15.995450+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqp87yyz_9aab22882a76":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mqp87yyz_9aab22882a76","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"name\":\"mcp-router-guide\"}","duration_ms":30,"error_message":null,"is_error":false,"result_preview":"{\"success\": true, \"name\": \"mcp-router-guide\", \"description\": \"Using the MCP Router app as the master proxy for all MCP servers, including native web search and fallback tool usage.\", \"tags\": [\"mcp\", \"mcp-router\", \"web-search\", \"brave\", \"duckduckgo\", \"tools\", \"fallback\"], \"related_skills\": [], \"content\": \"---\\nname: mcp-router-guide\\ndescription: \\\"Using the MCP Router app as the master proxy for all MCP servers, including native web search and fallback tool usage.\\\"\\nversion: 1.0.0\\nauthor: davec\\nmetadata:\\n  hermes:\\n    tags: [mcp, mcp-router, web-search, brave, duckduckgo, tools, fallback]\\n    portable: true\\n---\\n\\n# MCP Router Guide\\n\\nThe MCP Router app at `/Applications/MCP Router.app` is the **master proxy** for all MCP servers on this system.\\n\\n## Native Web Search\\n\\nThe native `web_search` tool now uses the Brave-native plugin (fixed). It works directly without going through MCP router.\\n\\n### Fallback Tools\\n\\nIf native `web_search` fails or returns no results, use these...","status":"ok","task_id":"d0a08acf-a7ac-42b5-a32c-4a12bd1ba020","tool_call_id":"call_ff67ac618000479db6207da2","tool_name":"skill_view","turn_id":"20260622_072250_b8ad7d:d0a08acf-a7ac-42b5-a32c-4a12bd1ba020:d981346a"},"sessionId":"20260622_072250_b8ad7d","timestamp":"2026-06-22T13:03:34.088384+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqp87yz0_7e5ca13044e4":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mqp87yz0_7e5ca13044e4","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"name\":\"ollama-provider-troubleshooting\"}","duration_ms":31,"error_message":null,"is_error":false,"result_preview":"{\"success\": true, \"name\": \"ollama-provider-troubleshooting\", \"description\": \"Configure local Ollama provider in Hermes, avoid model naming format conflicts\", \"tags\": [\"hermes\", \"ollama\", \"model\", \"configuration\"], \"related_skills\": [], \"content\": \"---\\nname: ollama-provider-troubleshooting\\ndescription: \\\"Configure local Ollama provider in Hermes, avoid model naming format conflicts\\\"\\nversion: 1.0.0\\nauthor: Hermes Agent\\nlicense: MIT\\nmetadata:\\n  hermes:\\n    tags: [hermes, ollama, model, configuration]\\n---\\n\\n# Ollama Provider Troubleshooting\\n\\n## Problem\\nWhen switching to Ollama models (`qwen3:1.7b`, `llama3.2:3b`), Hermes reports \\\"model not found\\\" because it converts the colon (`:`) to slash (`/`) format, which Ollama doesn't recognize.\\n\\n## Root Cause\\n1. **Model catalog normalization** (`model_catalog.enabled: true` by default) normalizes names to OpenRouter-style slashes\\n2. **Model-level `base_url`** and `api_key` override provider settings when set\\n\\n## Quick Fix\\n\\n`...","status":"ok","task_id":"d0a08acf-a7ac-42b5-a32c-4a12bd1ba020","tool_call_id":"call_75ebb5bdca4949b8b7f4d4e9","tool_name":"skill_view","turn_id":"20260622_072250_b8ad7d:d0a08acf-a7ac-42b5-a32c-4a12bd1ba020:d981346a"},"sessionId":"20260622_072250_b8ad7d","timestamp":"2026-06-22T13:03:34.088803+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqp885gz_2dd163b1a5f9":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mqp885gz_2dd163b1a5f9","raw":{"args_preview":"{}","duration_ms":12,"error_message":null,"is_error":false,"result_preview":"{\"success\": true, \"skills\": [{\"name\": \"macos-integrations\", \"description\": \"Apple/macOS local integrations: iMessage/SMS, Notes, Reminders, FindMy device tracking. Plus macos-launchd for background services and computer-use for desktop automation.\", \"category\": \"apple\"}, {\"name\": \"agentmemory-hermes-integration\", \"description\": \"Troubleshooting and rules for AgentMemory integration with Hermes Agent — session registration, title sync, and secret resolution.\", \"category\": \"autonomous-ai-agents\"}, {\"name\": \"hermes-agent\", \"description\": \"Configure, extend, or contribute to Hermes Agent.\", \"category\": \"autonomous-ai-agents\"}, {\"name\": \"hermes-workspace-context\", \"description\": \"Manage Hermes project roots, working directories, Desktop cwd launch behavior, profiles, and worktrees.\", \"category\": \"autonomous-ai-agents\"}, {\"name\": \"mcp-router-guide\", \"description\": \"Using the MCP Router app as the master proxy for all MCP servers, including native web search and fallback tool usage.\", \"catego...","status":"ok","task_id":"d0a08acf-a7ac-42b5-a32c-4a12bd1ba020","tool_call_id":"call_d15eafe797ca427bbd7ab028","tool_name":"skills_list","turn_id":"20260622_072250_b8ad7d:d0a08acf-a7ac-42b5-a32c-4a12bd1ba020:d981346a"},"sessionId":"20260622_072250_b8ad7d","timestamp":"2026-06-22T13:03:42.512383+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqp893vy_ce985802b456":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mqp893vy_ce985802b456","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"action\":\"create\",\"category\":\"creative\",\"content\":\"---\